         -> key in the display_value attribute AND in the element body.
         sys_user and sys_user_group reference bodies are never checked by
         preview (a deliberately bogus user_name produced no problem), and
         the import engine DOES resolve them: the demo users, the demo
         group and the three sys_user_has_role rows all landed on the
         instance under these artifacts' own sys_ids with their user and
         role references correctly resolved. These columns therefore
